ge2 — licence and third-party notices
=====================================

Your own terms
--------------

The ge2 framework code (css/ge2/*.css, js/ge2/ui.js, and the hydration
wrapper in js/ge2/icons.js) has no licence chosen yet. Replace this section
with your terms before distributing the project. Until then, default
copyright applies: no one else has permission to reuse it.

This file exists because the section below is a legal obligation regardless
of what you pick.


Third-party: Hugeicons
----------------------

js/ge2/icons.js embeds SVG path data for 42 icons taken verbatim from
@hugeicons/core-free-icons (Stroke Rounded, the free tier):

    https://github.com/hugeicons
    https://hugeicons.com

That package is MIT licensed, and MIT requires the notice below to travel
with any copy or substantial portion of the work — including every copy of
ge2 made into another project. Keep this file alongside js/ge2/icons.js.

Only the path data is Hugeicons'; the icx wrapper around it is ge2 code and
falls under "Your own terms" above.

